# Machine-owned and fully regenerable (D-66) — the plan and discussions.md are
# the committed half of this directory.
state.json
.matrix-structure.json
out/

# D-245: the activity ledger lives at ~/.matrix/<project.key>/log.jsonl now —
# outside the checkout, because a checkout is not the project and one project
# has several. These two lines are for instances created before the move, so a
# not-yet-migrated ledger and the `.migrated` file left behind stay ignored.
log.jsonl
log.jsonl.migrated*

# D-186: `matrix attach` copies a block's output here. The RECORD lives in
# plan.yaml and is committed; the bytes are not, because eval reports run to
# megabytes and the board serves them off this machine anyway. A checkout
# without them shows the record and says the file is not here — which is the
# truth, and better than a link into nothing.
#
# Un-ignore this line if an output is small and belongs with the plan.
artifacts/
